1
00:00:00,220 --> 00:00:02,051
Jackal, Stage 3.

2
00:00:02,081 --> 00:00:04,476
A battleship is docked at the end of the harbor.

3
00:00:04,656 --> 00:00:07,269
Six turrets, and you take them out one by one.

4
00:00:07,749 --> 00:00:09,439
The last one blows,

5
00:00:09,469 --> 00:00:11,760
and the whole ship burns and sinks.

6
00:00:11,940 --> 00:00:14,689
If you like this kind of fight, leave a like.

7
00:00:15,169 --> 00:00:18,164
This is the most-played of my remakes,

8
00:00:18,194 --> 00:00:20,252
but it only ever had two stages.

9
00:00:20,432 --> 00:00:23,212
So I followed the original Stage 3 map

10
00:00:23,242 --> 00:00:25,279
and built the whole harbor.

11
00:00:25,759 --> 00:00:28,435
The first build was a bit of a joke:

12
00:00:28,515 --> 00:00:31,344
every arrow on the ground came out as a letter Y,

13
00:00:31,374 --> 00:00:33,479
the sea was as bright as a swimming pool,

14
00:00:33,509 --> 00:00:36,048
and the ship's bridge was a black blob.

15
00:00:36,528 --> 00:00:38,981
After the fixes, it finally looks like a harbor.

16
00:00:39,461 --> 00:00:41,888
I also found an old problem:

17
00:00:41,968 --> 00:00:44,214
a new player who just stands still

18
00:00:44,244 --> 00:00:46,174
gets killed in eight seconds.

19
00:00:46,654 --> 00:00:49,589
Now, until you move, the enemies hold their fire,

20
00:00:49,619 --> 00:00:52,053
and a hint shows you how to drive.

21
00:00:52,533 --> 00:00:53,599
Back to the stage.

22
00:00:53,779 --> 00:00:56,550
Two piers run side by side into the sea,

23
00:00:56,580 --> 00:00:58,580
gunboats shoot at you from both sides,

24
00:00:58,610 --> 00:01:01,068
and a tank blocks the other pier.

25
00:01:01,548 --> 00:01:04,543
Don't ignore the parked jeeps.

26
00:01:04,723 --> 00:01:07,284
Blow this one up and there's a star hidden inside.

27
00:01:07,764 --> 00:01:10,920
The hardest part is the zigzag between the warehouses:

28
00:01:10,950 --> 00:01:13,618
cannons line the walls,

29
00:01:13,648 --> 00:01:16,161
and this run got wrecked here once.

30
00:01:16,641 --> 00:01:19,336
Get all twelve prisoners onto the helicopter,

31
00:01:19,366 --> 00:01:22,479
blow open the last gate, and you reach the dock.

32
00:01:22,959 --> 00:01:25,318
Press C for the low camera,

33
00:01:25,348 --> 00:01:27,694
and the harbor stands right in front of you.

34
00:01:28,174 --> 00:01:30,046
Stage 3 is live.

35
00:01:30,076 --> 00:01:33,445
It runs in the browser on desktop and phone; the link is in the description.

36
00:01:33,625 --> 00:01:35,363
The original has six stages.

37
00:01:35,393 --> 00:01:37,998
Which one should come next? Tell me in the comments.
